            {
              "code": 355,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "parameters": [
                "\\PN! I thought you were never going to catch up with me!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "parameters": [
                "I haven't ran into that Cynthia lady either... I thought she'd "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "parameters": [
                "be with you!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "parameters": [
                "Heh, it doesn't matter. I'm here to catch that powerful "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "parameters": [
                "Pokémon at the summit and I'll stop at nothing!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "parameters": [
                "I've been thinking about it and I'm pretty sure that it's a "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "parameters": [
                "legendary Pokémon. It just has to be!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "parameters": [
                "Anyway, I don't need your help to catch it. Or anyone else's "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "parameters": [
                "for that matter!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "parameters": [
                "But I could use a warm-up... How about a little fight? For "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "parameters": [
                "old time's sake!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 111,
              "parameters": [
                12,
                "pbTrainerBattle(PBTrainers::RIVAL1,\"Blue\",_I(\"Dang! You just keep getting stronger!\"),false,24,false)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "Humph... You beat me."
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "Darn it! I really wanted to be the one to catch this "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "Pokémon!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "But I have to admit that if anyone's got a chance to "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "capture it, it's gotta be you."
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "Alright then. You still a have way to go until you reach the "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "peak, so you better take this."
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "Kernel.pbReceiveItem(PBItems::HM10)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "Teach it to one of your Pokémon. It'll allow you to climb "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 401,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "up these annoying ledges!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 355,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "pbCallBub(2,3) "
              ]
            },
            {
              "code": 101,
              "indent": 1,
              "parameters": [
                "I'll try to go find Cynthia. Later!"
              ]
